From 9670dfc7c7e4f05ed4a5fb377e8911f59f1212b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lynn Chen <linxuanc@usc.edu>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 14:02:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] rl: optional relative finger actions (--relative-hand
 SCALE)

With absolute targets the fist policy's deterministic output never got closer
than 0.085 to the half-close pose (tolerance 0.05) in 10M steps. The wrapper
integrates finger actions into the targets so zero action holds, and appends
the targets to the observation. Task, reward and success are unchanged;
evaluate_bundle.py reads the setting from run_config.json.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
